    <string name="monitor_eyebrow">BLUETOOTH CUFF</string>
    <string name="monitor_title">Connect a monitor</string>
    <string name="monitor_intro">Find a cuff that advertises the Bluetooth SIG Blood Pressure Service (0x1810). The app works offline; measurements are encrypted locally as soon as they arrive.</string>
    <string name="monitor_manual_title">No cuff nearby?</string>
    <string name="monitor_manual_body">You can enter a reading by hand. For Bluetooth, the cuff must support the standard Blood Pressure Service (IEEE 11073-10407 / GATT 0x1810). Some brands use private protocols and are not supported yet.</string>
